{"i":0,"start_s":0.26,"end_s":7.94,"speaker":"SPEAKER_00","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Senator Brown and Senator Bennett for championing this issue for not this Congress, but for years."}
{"i":1,"start_s":8.23,"end_s":9.26,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Before I came"}
{"i":2,"start_s":9.27,"end_s":9.51,"speaker":"SPEAKER_00","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"to"}
{"i":3,"start_s":9.51,"end_s":11.63,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Washington, these"}
{"i":4,"start_s":11.63,"end_s":12.87,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"two men were"}
{"i":5,"start_s":13.59,"end_s":15.85,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"standing up and talking about"}
{"i":6,"start_s":16.32,"end_s":17.77,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"the moral core of"}
{"i":7,"start_s":17.77,"end_s":19.81,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"our country. If"}
{"i":8,"start_s":19.95,"end_s":21.96,"speaker":"SPEAKER_02","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"you want to see how a nation"}
{"i":9,"start_s":22.06,"end_s":22.72,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"is doing,"}
{"i":10,"start_s":22.72,"end_s":23.51,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Don't look at"}
{"i":11,"start_s":23.54,"end_s":33.2,"speaker":"SPEAKER_02","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"the buildings we build, how many billionaires we have, just look at children."}
{"i":12,"start_s":33.2,"end_s":36.64,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And what is galling me right now"}
{"i":13,"start_s":36.76,"end_s":37.85,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"is that we"}
{"i":14,"start_s":37.85,"end_s":44.43,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"have come to the one yard line, we are at an inflection point in our"}
{"i":15,"start_s":44.43,"end_s":46.03,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"country where we"}
{"i":16,"start_s":46.4,"end_s":48.87,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"have to ask the question, who"}
{"i":17,"start_s":48.87,"end_s":49.86,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"are we?"}
{"i":18,"start_s":49.86,"end_s":51.01,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"My friend,"}
{"i":19,"start_s":51.04,"end_s":52.95,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Senator Bennett, and"}
{"i":20,"start_s":52.95,"end_s":63.17,"speaker":"SPEAKER_05","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"I have been working with kids well before we came here, and he rattled off data that should be"}
{"i":21,"start_s":63.44,"end_s":65.94,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"repeated."}
{"i":22,"start_s":65.94,"end_s":73.94,"speaker":"SPEAKER_06","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"I say this is a moral issue, but he has shown this is an economic issue. We are the wealthiest nation on the planet Earth,"}
{"i":23,"start_s":73.94,"end_s":77.9,"speaker":"SPEAKER_07","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"and of the top 41 countries,"}
{"i":24,"start_s":77.89,"end_s":78.46,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"We're"}
{"i":25,"start_s":78.57,"end_s":83.2,"speaker":"SPEAKER_07","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"at 38 and poor kids. And"}
{"i":26,"start_s":83.34,"end_s":84.16,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"what he"}
{"i":27,"start_s":84.16,"end_s":95.59,"speaker":"SPEAKER_07","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"pointed out is that poverty costs all of us. It is a deep, self-inflicted wound in this society"}
{"i":28,"start_s":96.7,"end_s":107.91,"speaker":"SPEAKER_08","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"because poverty costs this nation over a trillion dollars as measured by economists. But I'm telling you right now, economists don't measure all the things that are important. Our GDP."}
{"i":29,"start_s":107.91,"end_s":123.92,"speaker":"SPEAKER_08","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"does not reflect well-being. It doesn't reflect how many antidepressants people take or how many child deaths there are. But the truth of our economy is every dollar we invest in getting children out of poverty returns $8 to this"}
{"i":30,"start_s":123.92,"end_s":125.08,"speaker":"SPEAKER_10","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"economy. So"}
{"i":31,"start_s":125.41,"end_s":127.28,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"it is an economic"}
{"i":32,"start_s":127.28,"end_s":129.91,"speaker":"SPEAKER_10","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"issue, clearly."}
{"i":33,"start_s":130.01,"end_s":130.87,"speaker":"SPEAKER_08","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":true,"text":"Clearly."}
{"i":34,"start_s":130.82,"end_s":131.27,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"It is a"}
{"i":35,"start_s":131.46,"end_s":142.64,"speaker":"SPEAKER_08","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"globally competitive issue because the nation in a global knowledge-based society, the nation whose children learn the most will earn the most"}
{"i":36,"start_s":142.64,"end_s":146.14,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"and will out-compete. It is a"}
{"i":37,"start_s":146.14,"end_s":153.78,"speaker":"SPEAKER_10","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"national security issue as we go up against countries like China, whose top 10% of"}
{"i":38,"start_s":153.82,"end_s":155.74,"speaker":"SPEAKER_12","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"their graduating high school classes"}
{"i":39,"start_s":156.32,"end_s":159.67,"speaker":"SPEAKER_12","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Outnumber all the children we have virtually. But"}
{"i":40,"start_s":159.67,"end_s":163.38,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"it is a moral issue,"}
{"i":41,"start_s":163.38,"end_s":173.49,"speaker":"SPEAKER_13","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"most of all. If we are going to create a more beloved community, how do we treat our children? Children"}
{"i":42,"start_s":173.49,"end_s":175.85,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"who live in"}
{"i":43,"start_s":175.85,"end_s":178.76,"speaker":"SPEAKER_13","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"poverty literally"}
{"i":44,"start_s":178.76,"end_s":179.08,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"have"}
{"i":45,"start_s":179.21,"end_s":182.69,"speaker":"SPEAKER_07","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"physical effects. Poverty is..."}
{"i":46,"start_s":182.91,"end_s":185.67,"speaker":"SPEAKER_07","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"is violence."}
{"i":47,"start_s":185.92,"end_s":187.38,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Study after"}
{"i":48,"start_s":188.31,"end_s":209.89,"speaker":"SPEAKER_14","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"study shows that the brain development of children in poverty is inhibited. Literally, the stress hormones, the cortisol, it is akin to an adult having a traffic accident every single day. It is an indicator of childhood"}
{"i":49,"start_s":209.89,"end_s":210.95,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"trauma."}
{"i":50,"start_s":210.91,"end_s":212.32,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Poverty"}
{"i":51,"start_s":212.46,"end_s":216.35,"speaker":"SPEAKER_14","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"is a moral obscenity,"}
{"i":52,"start_s":216.35,"end_s":218.18,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"and we, the"}
{"i":53,"start_s":218.27,"end_s":227.72,"speaker":"SPEAKER_14","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"richest nation on the planet, that year after year are rich are getting richer, our children are getting poorer. Who are we when"}
{"i":54,"start_s":227.72,"end_s":230.98,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"we pledge allegiance to a"}
{"i":55,"start_s":230.98,"end_s":237.46,"speaker":"SPEAKER_14","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"flag and say liberty and justice for all? Who"}
{"i":56,"start_s":238.22,"end_s":239.59,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"are we?"}
{"i":57,"start_s":239.58,"end_s":241.01,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"We don't even know"}
{"i":58,"start_s":241.24,"end_s":249.98,"speaker":"SPEAKER_14","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"the demographic changes in our country. We have cities across America where one out of every 10 child is being raised by a grandparent."}
{"i":59,"start_s":249.98,"end_s":250.89,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And so here"}
{"i":60,"start_s":250.89,"end_s":260.9,"speaker":"SPEAKER_06","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"we're discussing childhood poverty, and some people are talking about work requirements when we know from the data from conservative think tanks,"}
{"i":61,"start_s":260.88,"end_s":279.3,"speaker":"SPEAKER_06","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"to what we see in other nations like Canada, that things like the child allowance, or in our country, the child tax credit, increase workforce participation. But if you get rid of the child tax credit, those grandparents raising grandchildren, half of them plunge"}
{"i":62,"start_s":279.3,"end_s":279.5,"speaker":"SPEAKER_16","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"back"}
{"i":63,"start_s":279.87,"end_s":281.3,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"into poverty."}
{"i":64,"start_s":281.3,"end_s":282.2,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"and the"}
{"i":65,"start_s":283.12,"end_s":300.08,"speaker":"SPEAKER_06","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"stories are profound. You heard from my colleague in Colorado. We know families in New Jersey, like a woman I just saw named Margarita. She used her child tax credit payments for exactly what so many said they would be used for. She used them for food"}
{"i":66,"start_s":300.4,"end_s":304.21,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"for her children, for school"}
{"i":67,"start_s":304.54,"end_s":308.56,"speaker":"SPEAKER_18","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"supplies to keep the electricity running in her house."}
{"i":68,"start_s":308.56,"end_s":309.09,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"We've heard"}
{"i":69,"start_s":309.37,"end_s":331.57,"speaker":"SPEAKER_06","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"stories that they're used for a car bill to get people to work. They're used to pay for childcare that they need for their family so that they can work. Families are not using this money so they can quit their jobs. Quite the contrary, they're using them so they can get to work. Mr. President, we"}
{"i":70,"start_s":331.89,"end_s":331.98,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"are a"}
{"i":71,"start_s":332.02,"end_s":337.18,"speaker":"SPEAKER_06","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"nation in crisis because of how we treat our children."}
{"i":72,"start_s":337.35,"end_s":340.61,"speaker":"SPEAKER_06","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"The child tax credit is a lifeline"}
{"i":73,"start_s":340.76,"end_s":340.77,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"for"}
{"i":74,"start_s":340.81,"end_s":345.66,"speaker":"SPEAKER_09","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"the millions of grandparents raising grandchildren. It's a lifeline for low-income"}
